 <h3><u>Apni kismat azma kar dekhna</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>APNI QISMAT AAZMA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
  <p>TUM AZA KHANA SAJA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
  <p>KHUD MUNAFIQ KA PATA CHAL JAYEGA</p> 
  <p>NARA-E-HAIDER(A.S) KAR LAGA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
  <p>HO AGAR JANNAT ZAMEEN PER DEKHNI</p> 
  <p>KARBALA EK BAAR JA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
  <p>ANBIYA KO DEKHNA CHAHO AGAR</p> 
  <p>HALQA-E-MATAM MEIN AA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
  <p>TUM KO ZEHRA(A.S) KI DUA MIL JAYE GI</p> 
  <p>PARCHAM-E-GHAZI(A.S) UTHA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
  <p>WOH TAU PHIR MOLA ALI(A.S) HAIN HASHR MEIN</p> 
  <p>MARTABA QAMBER KA AA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
  <p>CHAND TAARAY DEKHNA CHAHO AGAR</p> 
  <p>DAAGH MATAM KE SAJA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
  <p>KHUSHBOO-E-ROOMAAL-E-ZEHRA(A.S) CHAHIYE</p> 
  <p>ASHQ MAJLIS MEIN BAHA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
  <p>PANJETAN MEHMAAN KHUD HONGAY ZAKI</p> 
  <p>FARSH MAJLIS KA BICHA KAR DEKHNA</p> 
